OL,3,AOasis confirm Knebworth return and
OL,4,AManchester and Glasgow live 2027 gigs
OL,5,
OL,6,FAfter weeks of posting teasers on
OL,7,Fsocial media and underneath the
OL,8,FManchester sky, Oasis have confirmed a
OL,9,Fsecond leg of their smash hit reunion
OL,10,Ftour for summer 2027.
OL,12,FThe band will return to the scene of
OL,13,Ftheir legendary 1996 gigs at Knebworth
OL,14,FHouse to play four nights at the
OL,15,F125,000-capacity venue in September
OL,16,Fnext year.
OL,18,FThey will also play a 11-night
OL,19,Fresidency at the home of their beloved
OL,20,FManchester City in June, after kicking
OL,21,Foff the tour with five gigs at
OL,22,FGlasgow's Celtic Park in May.
OL,23,APub: 14-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG9/17
OL,24,ANext PageBCultureC Nat RadioFTechnology
