OL,3,AEmmy Awards: How to watch, who is
OL,4,Anominated and why Heated Rivalry is
OL,5,Amissing
OL,6,
OL,7,FBeef, Hacks, Pluribus and The Pitt are
OL,8,Fa few of the TV shows nominated at this
OL,9,Fyear's Emmy Awards, which take place on
OL,10,FMonday in Los Angeles.
OL,12,FWidow's Bay, DTF St Louis, Slow Horses,
OL,13,FThe Bear and Abbott Elementary are also
OL,14,Fcompeting for prizes at the ceremony,
OL,15,Fwhich is seen as the US television
OL,16,Findustry's most prestigious event.
OL,18,FActors nominated for trophies include
OL,19,FZendaya, Noah Wyle, Sarah Snook and
OL,20,FColman Domingo, while Matthew Rhys,
OL,21,FCarey Mulligan and Jack Lowden are
OL,22,Famong the British nominees.
OL,23,APub: 13-SepQpppppppppppppppppppppG11/17
OL,24,ANext PageBCultureC Nat RadioFTechnology
