OL,5,G2100 The Blues Show with Shaun Keaveny
OL,6,     FShaun Keaveny sits in for Cerys
OL,7,     FMatthews and his guest is American
OL,8,     Fblues singer-songwriter Seasick
OL,9,     FSteve.
OL,10,G2200 The Good Groove with DJ Spoony
OL,11,     FFeelgood tunes to groove and
OL,12,     Fsoothe your soul. Dr Beat is also
OL,13,     Fon hand to prescribe a perfect
OL,14,     Ftune for a listener whose week
